#. module: pb_contract_rules
#: model:pb.contract.rule,counts_note:pb_contract_rules.rule_vn
msgid "Every fixed-term labour contract with this employer counts, also the ones signed before this system: type their number on the person. A trial (probation) agreement does not count."
