msgid "Labour Code 2019, article 20: a fixed-term contract runs at most 36 months; when it ends, one more fixed-term contract may be signed, and after that the contract should be permanent. There are exceptions (older workers, foreign workers, some union officials and state-enterprise managers). To confirm with an adviser."
msgstr "UU Ketenagakerjaan Vietnam 2019, pasal 20: kontrak waktu tertentu paling lama 36 bulan; setelah berakhir, satu kontrak waktu tertentu lagi boleh ditandatangani, dan sesudahnya kontrak harus tetap. Ada pengecualian (pekerja lanjut usia, pekerja asing, sebagian pengurus serikat dan manajer BUMN). Perlu dikonfirmasi dengan penasihat."

